        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, crude oil pipeline, onshore
Calculation for energy use. There are differences depending on diameter and difference of height.;
UUID: 3f3618e5-c52b-3a7e-8b59-81972146a159
Energy use for pumping and emissions of oil due to accidents.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Operation of crude oil pipelines by electricity.
Time period: Old publications for energy use. New study for oil losses.
Production volume: 79 miam3 tkm of transported crude oil in RER in 2015.
Sampling: Literature. 
Extrapolations: From single data to global situation.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3f3618e5-c52b-3a7e-8b59-81972146a159.xml</text>
